{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10287","headline":"送归中丞使新罗 · 皇甫曾","name":"送归中丞使新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南幰衔恩去，东夷泛海行。\n天遥辞上国，水尽到孤城。\n已变炎凉气，仍愁浩淼程。\n云涛不可极，来往见双旌。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}